WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.790
Welcome to the Big News Zone!

2
00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:05.190
Five games, ten managers, and one Monday night comeback.

3
00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:05.902
Let's go!

4
00:00:06.952 --> 00:00:12.436
We go live to New Orleans! Ian is winless, and he is 46.38 behind Gorvel with three players left.

5
00:00:12.516 --> 00:00:14.969
Tyler Shough, 286 yards!

6
00:00:15.049 --> 00:00:16.830
Devaughn Vele, into the end zone!

7
00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.561
Bijan Robinson, touchdown! And another one!

8
00:00:19.641 --> 00:00:21.545
That's 65.04 on Monday night!

9
00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:23.624
Ian wins it by 18.66!

10
00:00:23.704 --> 00:00:25.806
Four weeks in, Ian has his first win!

11
00:00:26.856 --> 00:00:28.931
Over to Dara, and somebody call a doctor.

12
00:00:29.011 --> 00:00:30.340
Jayden Daniels: out.

13
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:31.699
Terry McLaurin: out.

14
00:00:31.779 --> 00:00:32.875
Breece Hall: out.

15
00:00:32.955 --> 00:00:35.178
A.J. Brown and Travis Etienne: on IR.

16
00:00:35.258 --> 00:00:37.991
And Joe Mixon, signed after his game was already over.

17
00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.479
Dara's bench: 0.00.

18
00:00:40.559 --> 00:00:43.602
The only perfect lineup in the league, and the lowest score of the week!

19
00:00:44.652 --> 00:00:45.722
Transaction alert!

20
00:00:45.802 --> 00:00:51.166
05:25 on Monday morning: Dara drops Alvin Kamara for Joe Mixon, whose game was already over.

21
00:00:51.246 --> 00:00:53.375
Monday night. Kamara, touchdown!

22
00:00:53.455 --> 00:00:54.928
Kamara, touchdown again!

23
00:00:55.008 --> 00:00:59.063
22.80. More than anyone Dara started, and he scored it for nobody.

24
00:00:59.143 --> 00:01:02.213
It would not have won the game. It just would have been his best player.

25
00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:05.926
Let's go to the quad box, because the numbers were silly.

26
00:01:06.006 --> 00:01:08.384
Tetairoa McMillan, 46.20!

27
00:01:08.464 --> 00:01:10.616
CeeDee Lamb, 42.30!

28
00:01:10.696 --> 00:01:13.453
And on the benches: Kyle Monangai, 29.00!

29
00:01:13.533 --> 00:01:16.348
Joe Burrow, 428 passing yards!

30
00:01:16.428 --> 00:01:17.744
Both of them, benched!

31
00:01:18.794 --> 00:01:23.723
To Carolina, where Tom's Panthers stack goes off. He has the quarterback, and he has the receiver.

32
00:01:23.803 --> 00:01:26.768
166.96. Top score of the week.

33
00:01:26.848 --> 00:01:28.293
And Hegs is unbeaten no more!

34
00:01:28.373 --> 00:01:31.441
Tom's best possible lineup: 191.46.

35
00:01:31.521 --> 00:01:33.518
That would have been the highest score of the season!

36
00:01:34.568 --> 00:01:36.318
Now, the closest one of the week.

37
00:01:36.398 --> 00:01:38.746
Scody over Conor, by 3.02!

38
00:01:38.826 --> 00:01:41.617
Conor left Carnell Tate's 22.50 on the bench.

39
00:01:41.697 --> 00:01:45.938
Scody's kicker, Will Reichard: five field goals from five, 19.00 points.

40
00:01:46.018 --> 00:01:46.672
Ballgame!

41
00:01:47.722 --> 00:01:48.745
That's the whip-around!

42
00:01:48.825 --> 00:01:50.037
Jack is top of the table.

43
00:01:50.117 --> 00:01:51.098
Jake is 0-4.

44
00:01:51.178 --> 00:01:52.997
Ian, at last, is on the board.

45
00:01:53.077 --> 00:01:54.998
And Dara: Kamara is still out there.

46
00:01:55.078 --> 00:01:57.232
From the Big News Zone: don't tell your motha!

